.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Nothing generated lives in the repo. If you find yourself adding to this
# file, the thing you are ignoring probably belongs in
# ~/.config/kickstart/env or ~/.local/state/kickstart instead.

# Belt and braces for the secrets vault: only ciphertext and the recipient
# list are ever tracked. A stray decrypted file cannot be committed by accident.
secrets/*
!secrets/*.age
!secrets/recipients.txt
!secrets/README.md
